{"text": "I am the Head of the functional department . When I have detected a number of personnel requirements , I report the vacancy to the Personnel Department . Then I wait to get the job description for review before it is advertized . Under certain circumstances , I must ask for corrections again , otherwise I approve the job description . Sometimes it also happens that the colleague from the HR department still has questions about the tasks and requirements before he can describe the job . Then I am available for clarifications , of course .", "name": "doc-8.3", "id": "doc-8.3", "category": "", "tokens": [{"text": "I", "indexInDocument": 0, "posTag": "PRP", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "am", "indexInDocument": 1, "posTag": "VBP", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "the", "indexInDocument": 2, "posTag": "DT", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "Head", "indexInDocument": 3, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "of", "indexInDocument": 4, "posTag": "IN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "the", "indexInDocument": 5, "posTag": "DT", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "functional", "indexInDocument": 6, "posTag": "JJ", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "department", "indexInDocument": 7, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": ".", "indexInDocument": 8, "posTag": ".", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "When", "indexInDocument": 9, "posTag": "WRB", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "I", "indexInDocument": 10, "posTag": "PRP", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "have", "indexInDocument": 11, "posTag": "VBP", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "detected", "indexInDocument": 12, "posTag": "VBN", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "a", "indexInDocument": 13, "posTag": "DT", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "number", "indexInDocument": 14, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "of", "indexInDocument": 15, "posTag": "IN", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "personnel", "indexInDocument": 16, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 1}, {"text": "requirements", "indexInDocument": 17, "posTag": "NNS", "sentence