{"text": "The Police Report related to the car accident is searched within the Police Report database and put in a file together with the Claim Documentation . This file serves as input to a claims handler who calculates an initial claim estimate . Then , the claims handler creates an Action Plan based on an Action Plan Checklist available in the Document Management system . Based on the Action Plan , a claims manager tries to negotiate a settlement on the claim estimate . The claimant is informed of the outcome , which ends the process .", "name": "doc-3.7", "id": "doc-3.7", "category": "", "tokens": [{"text": "The", "indexInDocument": 0, "posTag": "DT", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "Police", "indexInDocument": 1, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "Report", "indexInDocument": 2, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "related", "indexInDocument": 3, "posTag": "JJ", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "to", "indexInDocument": 4, "posTag": "IN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "the", "indexInDocument": 5, "posTag": "DT", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "car", "indexInDocument": 6, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "accident", "indexInDocument": 7, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "is", "indexInDocument": 8, "posTag": "VBZ", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "searched", "indexInDocument": 9, "posTag": "VBN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "within", "indexInDocument": 10, "posTag": "IN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "the", "indexInDocument": 11, "posTag": "DT", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "Police", "indexInDocument": 12, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "Report", "indexInDocument": 13, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "database", "indexInDocument": 14, "posTag": "NN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "and", "indexInDocument": 15, "posTag": "CC", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "put", "indexInDocument": 16, "posTag": "VBN", "sentenceIndex": 0}, {"text": "in", "indexInDocument": 17, "posTag": "IN", "sentenceIndex": 0}